          Trzy kroki do rozwiązania
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">
          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Transparentność i jasna komunikacja to nasze priorytety.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 sm:gap-8 lg:gap-12">
        <!-- Step 1 -->
        <div class="relative p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-10 rounded-lg" style="background-color: var(--color-bg-subtle);">
          <div class="w-14 sm:w-16 h-14 sm:h-16 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center mb-6" style="background-color: var(--color-cta-bg);">
            <svg class="w-7 sm:w-8 h-7 sm:h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="color: var(--color-cta-text);" aria-hidden="true">
